          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">While selecting targets for this unit's Earthshaker Cannon, if you have no ready units except units with Artillery Support, you may'call for an artillery strike'. If you do, you may instead target an enemy unit within 24" of and visible to any of your infantry units within 24" of this unit. After this unit is targeted by one or more ranged attacks, you may roll a D6. On a 3+, until the end of the battle round, for each ranged attack that targets this unit, the Hit Roll for that attack is worsened by 1, and you cannot roll for this ability until the next battle round. After this unit's Move step, you may have its Earthshaker Cannon weapon lose Suppressive and gain Breach until the End step.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
